Project-Documentation
Project Overview
EduGenie is an AI-powered learning assistant designed to help students understand academic concepts, generate learning materials, answer questions, summarize study content, and support personalized learning. The system uses Google Gemini as the underlying generative AI model to provide interactive and context-aware responses.
The main objective of EduGenie is to provide students with an accessible virtual learning companion that can assist them anytime, rather than depending entirely on traditional classroom-based support.
Key Features
•	AI-based question answering
•	Concept explanation in simple language
•	Personalized learning assistance
•	Text summarization
•	Study-material generation
•	Quiz and question generation
•	Interactive chatbot
•	Doubt clarification
•	Topic-wise learning support
•	User-friendly student interface
