Phase 2: System Analysis
Objective
This phase analyzes how the proposed system will operate and how users will interact with it.
Existing System
Traditional learning generally depends on:
•	Classroom teaching
•	Textbooks
•	Search engines
•	Recorded lectures
•	Online educational platforms
•	Direct interaction with teachers
These approaches may not always provide immediate, personalized responses to individual doubts.
Proposed System
EduGenie provides an AI-based conversational learning environment where students can ask questions and receive generated explanations using Google Gemini.
