4. Expected Outcome
The completed EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant should provide students with an interactive AI-based learning environment capable of answering questions, explaining concepts, generating educational content, and supporting self-paced learning. The project demonstrates how generative AI can be integrated into an educational application to provide personalized and interactive academic assistance.

